{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司（Apple）首款折疊屏手機iPhone Duo周五（16日）起於本港預訂【相關報道】。</p><p>營運總裁Sabih Khan周日（11日）到訪製造iPhone的最大工廠河南鄭州富士康科技園，參觀iPhone Duo、iPhone 18 Pro系列等產品的生產線。</p><p>他稱團隊一直在為iPhone Duo推進製造開發，目前正按照蘋果一貫的質量標準，擴大生產規模。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T11:59:20.098829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T16:37:49.729804+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:57:38.878640+00:00","content_hash":"1086b758767be63162365ff929defc8eb344ac5dc568b7633c9213439e5f3652","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}